{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9316c650-eb2f-4ce1-9dca-8fc0c0442e57",
    "name": "Email Classifier API",
    "description": "REST API for email classification. Accepts .eml files and returns classification status.\n\n**Base URL:** `{{base_url}}`\n\n**Docs:** `{{base_url}}/api/docs`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "13799625"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Classify",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /classify — upload .eml file",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// If no file is attached — create a minimal .eml manually (see request description)",
                  "",
                  ""
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has required fields', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('status');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('reviewed');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status is pending on creation', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('pending');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('reviewed is false on creation', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.reviewed).to.eql(false);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('id is a valid UUID', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const uuidRegex = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i;",
                  "    pm.expect(json.id).to.match(uuidRegex);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Save id for subsequent requests",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('created_email_id', json.id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved email id:', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "description": "Upload an .eml file. For a quick test use any file from the test_samples/ folder.",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/classify/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "classify",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Uploads an .eml file and creates a classification record.\n\n**How to use:**\n1. Click the `file` field → Select Files\n2. Pick any `.eml` file\n3. Click Send\n\nNo .eml file? Create one manually:\n```\ncat > test_samples/sample.eml << 'EOF'\nFrom: sender@example.com\nTo: receiver@example.com\nSubject: Test email\nDate: Mon, 19 May 2026 10:00:00 +0000\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\n\nThis is a test email body.\nEOF\n```\n\n**Response 201 (new file):**\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"status\": \"pending\",\n  \"category\": null,\n  \"confidence\": null,\n  \"reasoning\": null,\n  \"signals\": null,\n  \"reviewed\": false\n}\n```\n\n**Response 200 (duplicate — same SHA-256):** returns the existing record."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 — Created",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [
                    {
                      "key": "file",
                      "type": "file",
                      "src": [
                        "sample.eml"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/classify/",
                  "host": [
                    "{{base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "v1",
                    "classify",
                    ""
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"status\": \"pending\",\n  \"category\": null,\n  \"confidence\": null,\n  \"reasoning\": null,\n  \"signals\": null,\n  \"reviewed\": false\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "422 — File missing",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": []
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/classify/",
                  "host": [
                    "{{base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "v1",
                    "classify",
                    ""
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"detail\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"missing\",\n      \"loc\": [\"body\", \"file\"],\n      \"msg\": \"Field required\",\n      \"input\": null\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /classify/{id} — get classification result",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Use the id saved after the POST request",
                  "const id = pm.collectionVariables.get('created_email_id');",
                  "if (id) {",
                  "    pm.variables.set('email_id', id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has all required fields', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('status');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('category');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('confidence');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('reasoning');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('signals');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('reviewed');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status is one of known values', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(['pending', 'classified', 'failed']).to.include(json.status);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('If classified, category and confidence are present', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.status === 'classified') {",
                  "        const validCategories = ['spam', 'phishing', 'newsletter', 'transactional', 'personal', 'automated'];",
                  "        pm.expect(validCategories).to.include(json.category);",
                  "        pm.expect(json.confidence).to.be.a('number');",
                  "        pm.expect(json.confidence).to.be.within(0, 1);",
                  "        pm.expect(json.signals).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/classify/{{created_email_id}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "classify",
                "{{created_email_id}}",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns current status and classification result by UUID.\n\n`{{created_email_id}}` is populated automatically after the POST request.\n\n**Statuses:**\n- `pending` — waiting to be processed by the classify worker\n- `classified` — classification complete\n- `failed` — processing error (retry worker will reset to pending)\n\n**Response 200 (classified):**\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"status\": \"classified\",\n  \"category\": \"newsletter\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.95,\n  \"reasoning\": \"...\",\n  \"signals\": [\"unsubscribe link\", \"...\"]\n  \"reviewed\": false\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Pending (awaiting worker)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/classify/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/",
                  "host": [
                    "{{base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "v1",
                    "classify",
                    "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
                    ""
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"status\": \"pending\",\n  \"category\": null,\n  \"confidence\": null,\n  \"reasoning\": null,\n  \"signals\": null,\n  \"reviewed\": false\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 — Classified (result ready)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/classify/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/",
                  "host": [
